# Optional GitHub token for syncing from a private repository and uploading match dumps.
# Prefer saving via: run_sync.bat auth --token YOUR_TOKEN
#
# Or set one of these environment variables instead:
# PVL_GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
# GITHUB_TOKEN=ghp_...
#
# Match dumps are written to Data/match-exports/ in the configured repo:
#   - match-dump.json         consolidated rolling dump
#   - batches/batch-*.json    one file per upload batch
#
# The token needs Contents write access to push match exports to GitHub.

# Optional bearer token for the public community match export ingest API.
# Prefer saving via: run_sync.bat upload-auth --url URL --token TOKEN
#
# Or set:
# PVL_UPLOAD_TOKEN=your-ingest-token
